    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30161" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγκατά-ληψις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>catching</i> or <i>being caught in</i> a place,
				<i>being hemmed in</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				5.72
			</span></i>; <i>suppression</i> of urine, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				6.2.7
			</span></i> (codd.sedleg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγκατάλειψις</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>concept</i> ( 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατάληψις</span>
			), <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				14.685
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				19.350
			</span></i>.</div>
